## Where things live
_Generated by `ops/polaris where` from ops/MAP.md and the folder guides — edit those, not this._
- `bin/run` — the launcher — starts everything
- `src/main.ts` — boots the app — reads the config, opens the store, mounts every view, then greets our café…
- `src/cli.ts` — the command-line entry, written in INIT's list form
- `src/api/` — src/api/ — the HTTP handlers · guide
- `docs/` — how-tos and decisions
- `lib/new.sh` — new: the helper the first task added
- `tools/gen.sh` — a delta done appended below a later heading still counts
- `src/ui/` — src/ui/ — the screens · guide
<!-- /polaris:where -->
